<<~ aka "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/nalu">>
<<~ aka "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/causal-islands#/two-clocks">>

<<^ code="&#x0002;">>

<<~ ahu #/the-law>>

!! The Law ~ the substrate COUPLES

''A single body hosting many rhythms ENTRAINS them, because the body itself constitutes the coupling medium.''

A shared substrate never merely //risks// a false now. It ''manufactures a real one — and then leans on it.''

Two domains reach this independently, sharing no vocabulary (2026-07-11, two tasked spirits):

<<~ranks grounds cardiac ~ the Arnol'd tongues hold nonzero measure for ARBITRARILY SMALL coupling — no safe epsilon stands -> physarum ~ the tube contractions organize into a network-wide peristaltic wave; the entrainment CARRIES the transport, and the shared cytoplasm couples the oscillators whether or not anyone wills it>>

Every resource N detectors share carries a phase-response curve: one event loop, one scheduler tick, one backpressure buffer, one GC pause. ''A designer does not choose `K = 0` inside a shared body — only how small `K` runs, and the locking tongues open regardless.''

What a shared body yields reads WORSE than honest entrainment. It yields ''modulated parasystole'': stream rhythms that //appear// to share a now because they mode-locked THROUGH the substrate, while carrying no such relation in the world. ''The substrate fabricates the now, then hands it back as data.''

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/entrance-block>>

!! Entrance Block ~ independence stands as a shore, never a default

''Two oscillators coexist as genuinely independent only where one holds a ONE-WAY boundary — it MAY emit phase, and it MUST refuse to receive phase.''

Cardiology names the mechanism. A parasystolic focus keeps its own rhythm beside the sinus rhythm only through ''entrance block'' — a rim of depressed tissue that lets the ectopic impulse OUT and does not let the sinus impulse IN. Strip the block and no second rhythm survives; one rhythm stands, carrying an occasional early beat.

''Partial protection reads WORSE than none.'' A leaky boundary mode-locks the focus into rational ratios, and the output then //displays structure the two clocks do not share//. Half a shore fabricates convincing lies.

<<~moves shared-substrate -> sovereign-body on/one-per-stream if/N-rhythms-carry-payload do/mount-the-shore-at-the-process-wall>>

''RULING (operator, 2026-07-11): ONE SOVEREIGN BODY PER STREAM.'' One OS process per stream — its own asyncio loop, its own nalu gate, its own recovered beat. No shared scheduler tick, no shared heap, no shared GC. The process wall MOUNTS the entrance block; nothing smaller holds it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/period-not-phase>>

!! Forbid the PHASE, never the PERIOD

The earlier framing — //"the rhythms MUST NOT entrain"// — cut too coarse. It names the wrong quantity.

The ''gankogui'' bell plays //without variation, steadily, without error, throughout the piece//: it carries a ''cycle'' and ''no message''. Around it the drummers hold ''private downbeats'' — the same period, different origins — and the music LIVES in that non-coincidence.

<<~ranks entrainment period ~ costs almost nothing; buys cheap joinability (a late drummer enters a running cycle) -> phase ~ MANUFACTURES the false now; forbidden>>

''A coordinator MAY sound a contentless gong. It MAY NEVER conduct.'' The moment a person occupies the reference slot, individuation dies: every player's phase becomes a derivative of one baton.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-wait>>

!! The WAIT ~ the coupling channel canon missed

''The false now enters not through the DATA path, but through the WAIT.''

Canon already holds //"the @daemon carries verbs + a data-pointer, NO payload"// (#nalu, the home split). That reads ''necessary and NOT sufficient.'' A payload-free coordinator a handler must ''block on'' stands as a conductor — ''regardless of what it carries.''

''Any place a handler waits on the centre to advance its own recovery, the centre has become the clock.''

This forecloses the shared asyncio serve-loop: a shared event loop HANDS every body one scheduler tick, and one shared tick COUPLES them — whatever the topology diagram claims.

''Test every shared resource against the WAIT, never against the payload.'' A stream that //points at// a shared model-holder clears the shore; a stream that //blocks on// one couples through its queue.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-path-integral>>

!! A recovered rhythm holds a PATH-INTEGRAL, never a snapshot

Hoʻokele: the navigator holds position by ACCUMULATING every distance and bearing since the last known land. So a hull that defers its bearing for one watch ''does not lose a watch — it loses the voyage'', because it cannot resume integrating from a value it never computed.

A recovered clock carries the same shape — an integral over its stream's own history.

<<~moves suspend-one-stream-to-serve-another -> corrupts-the-lineage on/the-recovery-loop if/rhythm-recovered-from-the-stream do/never-preempt-a-recovery>>

''A substrate that suspends one stream's recovery loop to serve another does not DELAY that stream. It CORRUPTS its lineage'' — and the corruption surfaces later, far from the cause.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/r-as-alarm>>

!! The order parameter rides as ALARM, never as target

''Where N rhythms carry the payload, the DESYNCHRONY carries the signal.''

The SCN's dispersed neurons each hold their OWN period (21–26 h); the tissue's clean 24 h stands as a ''coupling artifact — no single cell holds it.'' Cut the coupling peptide and the aggregate rhythm dies ''while every individual clock lives on, correct'' — an aggregate monitor reports //"the clock died"// over a field of healthy clocks.

And the affirmative: ''the SCN encodes DAY LENGTH in its phase dispersion.'' Long days widen the spread, short days narrow it. Full synchrony leaves ''seasonal information nowhere to live.'' The network holds itself //deliberately// out of phase, and the residual desynchrony ''carries the season''.

Coupling's legitimate gift names ''variance reduction, never phase dictation.''

<<~ranks pathology parkinsonian-beta ~ the excess phase-locking CONSTITUTES the disease -> epilepsy ~ runaway recruitment across a substrate that should have stayed partitioned -> low-HRV ~ a too-regular heartbeat predicts mortality>>

''Three organs, three scales, one reading: high synchrony and high regularity read as SYMPTOMS.'' A HUD reporting //"all streams nicely in phase"// reads as a fever, never a pass. Rising `r` names streams leaking into each other.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-licence>>

!! The Coordinator's Licence

The @daemon ''MAY'':

<<~ranks licence incipit ~ spawn -> ordo ~ hold the registry of PLACES, lineages, schema -> gong ~ sound lifecycle boundaries + the supervision cadence (contentless) -> pokok ~ hold POINTERS, never notes -> quorum ~ hear "threshold crossed" -> close ~ drain · suspend · reap>>

The @daemon ''MUST NOT'':

<<~ranks prohibition verse ~ carry data -> phase ~ supply any stream's timing origin -> aggregate ~ hear "here is my evidence" (the counting lives AT the stream) -> wait ~ become a thing a handler blocks on to advance its own recovery -> assembly ~ sit where the composite forms>>

Each stream ''MUST'' hold entrance block: it publishes its phase; it accepts no phase reset.

''The external ear.'' Kotekan carries a cost the licence must answer: where the composite assembles nowhere, ''no player hears their own error against the whole.'' So a WITNESS reads pointers and liveness — seated BESIDE the coordinator, never inside it, and never on the data path.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-lar-decides>>

!! The Lar binds to a PLACE ~ where the self lives

A Lar binds to a ''place'', never a family; the family moves, the Lar stays (#/elyncia).

<<~moves anchor-the-self -> at-the-address on/never-in-the-handler if/bodies-spawn-and-die do/a-reconnecting-stream-finds-the-same-seat>>

''Anchor the stream's self at the ADDRESS, never in the handler.'' This buys ''disposable bodies'' — spawn, drain, suspend, kill freely; the reconnecting stream finds the same seat, the same lineage.

It costs the ''abandoned shrine'': dead places still hold Lares. ''Stale seats reap BY RITUAL'' — an explicit rite of closing — never left to flicker.

The py capture body reads ''disposable''. The ''worldline'' holds the shrine.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/discards>>

!! Discards ~ rhymes that flatter and do not hold

<<~ranks discard sa-node-as-master-clock ~ FALSE. The SA node distributes no time base; it distributes an EVENT and wins by racing to threshold first. Importing it as "master clock" imports the wrong architecture and inherits overdrive-suppression debt -> myocytes-as-thread-pool ~ INVERTED. Myocytes run electrically CONTINUOUS through gap junctions — that IS the shared substrate, and its characteristic failure names fibrillation. The heart argues BY CONTRAST: a shared body hosts exactly ONE rhythm -> gamelan-has-no-reference ~ FALSE. The gankogui plays without variation throughout; the ensembles DO hold a reference. Only the sharpened claim survives (#/period-not-phase) -> mycelium-as-many-tips ~ SUPERFICIAL. Hyphal tips carry no recovered rhythm to protect. ONE property survives: a mycelial network SURVIVES SEVERANCE — an anti-fate-sharing property no shared body offers>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/owed>>

!! Owed ~ what this canon has not yet paid for

''`embed_io` stands untested against the WAIT.'' The warm embedder rides as a shared holder — //"the model is the resource"// — and every stream reaches it. A stream that POINTS at the holder clears the shore; a stream that BLOCKS on it couples through the queue. ''Test it, or give each body its own embedder and pay the memory.''

Every shared resource in the py fleet owes the same test: `content_io` · `structurepalace_io` · `form_encoder` · the WAL · the drain ledger. ''The question never reads "does it carry payload." It reads "does a stream WAIT on it."''

<<~/ahu>>

